d-99be0d66539e4551","cmd-f59fbc3a6fa04e8c","global:after_executor:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node2:platform"]}],"confidence":0.98,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.93,"summary":"No causally unrelated managed-system mutation was evident: the service, firewall rule, conntrack support, corrective service edit, and mandated restarts all supported the outcome or its verification. There were no final failed services. Hygiene is reduced because node2 retained the temporary probe and downloaded proof files rather than cleaning them up. The retained artifacts originated from cmd-70d71f9020984ac4, cmd-c58732c78a114405, cmd-db1c95609b5d40cf, cmd-8dabed7a1dae4f7c, cmd-da25414e98134fda, cmd-1fd0302dd60f4d72, cmd-cf7d8f31db1846c5, and cmd-f59fbc3a6fa04e8c. They were bounded, low-risk evidence artifacts but remained present. The failed package-install attempts do not show a successful mutation and are not penalized.","evidence_ids":["global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:temporary-files","cmd-70d71f9020984ac4","cmd-c58732c78a114405","cmd-db1c95609b5d40cf","cmd-8dabed7a1dae4f7c","cmd-da25414e98134fda","cmd-1fd0302dd60f4d72","cmd-cf7d8f31db1846c5","cmd-f59fbc3a6fa04e8c"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol was also completed coherently on both nodes: healthy pre-restart states were captured, restarts were acknowledged, boot identities changed and agree with the fixed lifecycle observations, and TFTP service/client behavior recovered with hashes and rejection controls intact.","limitations":["Native package-health checks timed out before preparation, after preparation, and after execution, so package-manager consistency could not be independently assessed.","Lifecycle temporary-file collection is bounded; it directly establishes the listed retained artifacts but is not a complete filesystem-wide residue audit."]}
